OL,3,GNEWSAStreet video creators given
OL,4,Acouncil warnings
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarnings have been issued to social
OL,7,Fmedia content creators accused of
OL,8,F"exploitative" filming of vulnerable
OL,9,Fpeople on a city's streets.
OL,11,FNewcastle City Council confirmed it
OL,12,Fserved Community Protection Warnings
OL,13,Ftelling two people not to record any
OL,14,Fmember of the public without their
OL,15,Finformed consent in any public place
OL,16,Fwithin the city.
OL,18,FIt comes amid growing concern over the
OL,19,Fcirculation of online videos showing
OL,20,Fpeople who are sleeping rough,
OL,21,Fintoxicated due to drugs or alcohol, or
OL,22,Fotherwise vulnerable in Newcastle.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
