OL,4,Acouncil warnings
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 5,600 people have signed a
OL,7,Fpetition calling on Tyneside
OL,8,Fauthorities to mount a crackdown on
OL,9,Fwhat it called "public humiliation for
OL,10,Fentertainment".
